  "notes": "One record for les Ministraux (Ministral 3B and Ministral 8B), announced together. Slug ministral-1 because the family id is mistral.ministral. The announcement gives the API names ministral-8b-latest and ministral-3b-latest; the dated ids come from the changelog and docs. Release date conflict: announcement 2024-10-16, changelog and docs 2024-10-09 (alternative). The Hugging Face repository Ministral-8B-Instruct-2410 was created on 2024-10-15 (a lead only). The docs show the version as 24.1 (meaning 24.10). Cloud partners were announced as coming shortly, so cloud-partner access is not recorded."
